  "body": "Big family? Extended family? Need room to spread out? This one could tick more boxes than you think!\r\n\r\nIf space, sea views and flexibility are high on your wish list, then stop scrolling and take a closer look at what this Manly property has to offer.  Positioned on an impressive 1,201m² freehold clifftop site, this substantial home delivers approximately 330m² of living, sweeping sea views and a layout that opens up plenty of possibilities.\r\n\r\nForget feeling cramped. Here, there's room for everyone to enjoy their own space, come together as a family and make the most of an incredible coastal setting.\r\n\r\nHere's what makes this property worth viewing:\r\n* Five generous bedrooms - space for growing families, guests or extended family.\r\n* Three bathrooms - including ensuite facilities for added comfort and convenience.\r\n* Two separate living areas - room for entertaining, relaxing or giving the kids their own space.\r\n* Spectacular seaviews - an elevated clifftop position with beautiful sunrises, sunsets and ever-changing sea views.\r\n* Garaging and extensive additional parking - ideal for families with multiple vehicles\r\n* Flexible living options - ideal for larger families, guests, working from home or those exploring extended-family living.\r\n\r\nFantastic Manly location - close to beaches, schools, cafés, shops and local amenities.\r\n\r\nA Home That Works for More Than One Lifestyle\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a substantial family home, space for multiple generations or simply somewhere you can spread out without compromising on location, this property offers options that are becoming harder to find.\r\nThere's character, personality and a relaxed coastal feel throughout, with the bonus of breathtaking water views that never get old.\r\n\r\nAnd here's the opportunity: Our vendors are ready for their next move and invite genuine buyers to come and explore what's on offer.\r\n\r\nA building report is available to interested purchasers, making it easier to get started with your due diligence.\r\n\r\nStill searching? Been watching? Or simply curious?\r\n\r\nTo view the property documents copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/JD7W",
